    a^{2024}+b^{2024}> c^{2024},
    b^{2024}+c^{2024}> a^{2024},
    c^{2024}+a^{2024}> b^{2024}
\end{cases} $$   
Find the number of ordered triples  $(a,b,c)$  such that  $a,b,c$  are integers between  $1$  and  $2024$  (inclusive) and  $a,b,c$  are the sides of a *virtual* triangle.

